abstract: "Witnora-Core v2.26 is a public release package for a certified collapse hierarchy for verifier-to-witness SAT reasoning, including native certificates, obstruction-to-operator planning, planner-guided finite execution, G9-G13 soundness sketches, and TC-063 as a restricted theorem with proof obligations over SAF(c,r)."
